## 9. Reference commands

```bash
# Source (ONLY jazzy)
source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash

# Verify environment
echo $ROS_DISTRO                       # → jazzy
gz sim --versions                      # → 8.11.0
ros2 pkg list | grep -E "gz_ros2_control|controller_manager|ros_gz_sim"

# Smoke test Gazebo
gz sim -v 4 shapes.sdf

# Build
cd ~/dobot_cobot_gazebo_twin
rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y
colcon build --symlink-install
source install/setup.bash

# Spawn a model into a running Gazebo (Harmonic syntax)
ros2 run ros_gz_sim create -topic robot_description -name <robot_name>

# Controller checks
ros2 control list_controllers
ros2 control list_hardware_interfaces
```

---

## 10. Known risks

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| No M1 Pro ROS 2 URDF exists | Placeholder primitives first; meshes later. Already the plan. |
| Pro 600 not in any Jazzy repo | Adapt myCobot 280/320 xacro structure. |
| gz-sim8 vs gz-sim9 collision | `gz --force-version 8` if it misresolves. |
| Wrong distro sourced | Only ever `source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash`. |
| Gazebo picks integrated GPU | PRIME offload env vars. |
| Scope creep vs 48h clock | Section 7 is the contract. Cut ruthlessly. |
| Placeholder dims mistaken for real | Flagged in-file. Never quote reach numbers from them. |

